{{- /*
Renders "true" on an Omarchy host and the empty string everywhere else.

Consume it with includeTemplate, which returns the rendered text:

  {{- $omarchy := includeTemplate "omarchy-detect.tmpl" . -}}
  {{ if $omarchy }}...{{ end }}

Four signals, because no single one covers every way an apply is invoked:

  osRelease.id       Omarchy sets ID=omarchy in /etc/os-release. This needs no
                     environment and no filesystem probe, so it is the one
                     signal a systemd unit, a cron job or `ssh host chezmoi
                     apply` can always see.
  OMARCHY_PATH       Set by `omarchy dev link` to a working tree outside both
                     standard locations. Checked first so a dev-linked tree
                     still counts, but never relied on alone: it is exported
                     only by shells that ran Omarchy's env-bootstrap. The
                     variable outlives the tree it points at, so existence of
                     the path is not enough. Require the `default` directory
                     every Omarchy tree carries, or a stale variable pointing
                     at any surviving directory would claim a plain Linux host
                     and run `omarchy pkg add` there.
  /usr/share/omarchy Omarchy 4 ships the desktop as a package here.
  ~/.local/share/... Omarchy 3 and earlier used a git clone in the home
                     directory. Kept so an unmigrated host still matches, but
                     Omarchy 3 is not a supported deployment target.

Keying off OMARCHY_PATH alone, with the v3 clone path as the only fallback,
is what silently took the non-Omarchy branch on Omarchy 4 whenever the
variable was absent.
*/ -}}
{{- $omarchy := false -}}
{{- if eq .chezmoi.os "linux" -}}
{{-   $envPath := env "OMARCHY_PATH" -}}
{{-   if and $envPath (ne (stat (joinPath $envPath "default")) nil) -}}
{{-     $omarchy = true -}}
{{-   else if eq (.chezmoi.osRelease.id | default "") "omarchy" -}}
{{-     $omarchy = true -}}
{{-   else if ne (stat "/usr/share/omarchy") nil -}}
{{-     $omarchy = true -}}
{{-   else if ne (stat (joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir ".local/share/omarchy")) nil -}}
{{-     $omarchy = true -}}
{{-   end -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- if $omarchy }}true{{ end -}}
